msgid "Workshop Preparation Reference"
msgstr "Workshop 준비 참고"

msgid ""
"For workshop organizers: build the container and download the lesson models on each station "
"before learners arrive."
msgstr "운영자는 수강생 도착 전에 각 station의 container를 build하고 실습 model을 download하세요."

msgid "Clone the Repository and Build the Container"
msgstr "Repository Clone과 Container Build"

msgid "Run these commands **on the host**, with Git LFS and Docker installed:"
msgstr "Git LFS와 Docker가 설치된 **host에서** 다음을 실행합니다."

msgid "Download the Lesson Models"
msgstr "실습 Model Download"

msgid ""
"Run these commands **on the host**, using the Hugging Face CLI (`hf`). They fill the host cache "
"that the container mounts, so the lesson commands can keep using their published model IDs. You "
"can download the models before launching the container."
msgstr ""
"Hugging Face CLI(`hf`)로 **host에서** 실행합니다. Container가 mount할 host cache를 채우므로 실습 명령에서 공개 model ID를"
" 그대로 사용할 수 있습니다. Container 시작 전에도 download 가능합니다."

msgid ""
"If the CLI is only available inside the container, you can run the same commands there with the "
"cache mount below in place."
msgstr "CLI가 container에만 있다면 아래 cache mount를 적용한 뒤 내부에서 같은 명령을 실행합니다."

